🛡️ Security Features
Bcrypt Hashing: Passwords are never stored in plain text.
Session Management: Server-side sessions prevent unauthorized API access.
TOTP 2FA: Protects your dashboard even if your password is compromised.
Polling Control: Fixed bot logic to ensure the process stops correctly when requested.
Created for the QuantPy VR-Bank Integration.
